# 擋面歧義:L 形凹邊 e2(v=1000,u∈[2000,4000]) 與已放角材 A 的側面
# 同樣在 v=1000 且都涵蓋新料全寬 → 起點擋面不唯一 → 拒絕
surface 1 origin 0 0 2500 u +x v +y outline 0,0 2000,0 2000,1000 4000,1000 4000,3000 0,3000
grid 1 on 1 u 3000
timber 1 1000 20 20 role primary
timber 2 20 20 role secondary
place 1 on 1 at 2500 1000 +u +n
place 2 on 1 at-grid 1 u 0 +v +n
